{"code":"ru","name":"Russian","native":"Русский","phase":1,"medium":"en","file_level":"A2","level":{"title":"Elementary: past, future, cases, food","goals":["Talk about past and future with correct endings","Use accusative and prepositional cases","Shop, order food and name prices"],"units":[{"id":"A2-U1","title":"Past and future","lessons":[{"id":"A2-U1-L1","title":"Past tense: говорил/говорила","learn":"The past is beautifully simple: one form per gender! Я/ОН ГОВОРИЛ (m), Я/ОНА ГОВОРИЛА (f), ОНО ГОВОРИЛО (n), ОНИ ГОВОРИЛИ. Drop -ТЬ, add -Л + ending. Your gender picks the ending when YOU speak!","vocab":[{"t":"вчера","r":"fchih-RAH","en":"yesterday","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"сегодня","r":"sih-VOHD-nyah","en":"today","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"завтра","r":"ZAHF-trah","en":"tomorrow","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"утром","r":"OO-trah-m","en":"in the morning","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"вечером","r":"vih-CHOH-rahm","en":"in the evening","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"ночью","r":"NOH-chyoo","en":"at night","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"потом","r":"pah-TOHM","en":"then / later","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"уже","r":"oo-ZHEH","en":"already","pos":"adverb"}],"grammar":{"title":"Past: -л/-ла/-ло/-ли","explain":"ГОВОРИТЬ → ГОВОРИЛ (he/I-m), ГОВОРИЛА (she/I-f), ГОВОРИЛО (it), ГОВОРИЛИ (they/we/you). Women say Я ГОВОРИЛА, men say Я ГОВОРИЛ — the speaker's own gender decides!","pattern":"stem + л/ла/ло/ли","examples":[{"t":"Я говорил по-русски.","r":"yah gah-vah-REEL pah-ROO-skee.","en":"I spoke Russian. (man speaking)"},{"t":"Она говорила громко.","r":"ah-NAH gah-vah-REE-lah GROHM-kah.","en":"She spoke loudly."},{"t":"Мы уже ели.","r":"mih oo-ZHEH YEH-lee.","en":"We already ate."}],"mistakes":["Women saying Я ГОВОРИЛ — women say ГОВОРИЛА!","Forgetting the ending: ГОВОРИЛ alone is masculine-only."]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"Анна","t":"Что ты делал вчера?","r":"shtoh tih DYEH-lah-l fchih-RAH?","en":"What did you do yesterday? (to a man)"},{"sp":"Иван","t":"Я работал, а потом гулял.","r":"yah rah-BOH-tah-l, ah pah-TOHM goo-LYAHL.","en":"I worked, then went for a walk."},{"sp":"Анна","t":"А я читала книгу вечером.","r":"ah yah chee-TAH-lah KNEE-goo VIH-chih-rahm.","en":"And I read a book in the evening."},{"sp":"Иван","t":"Интересно!","r":"een-tyih-RYEHS-nah!","en":"Interesting!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say (woman): I spoke Russian","answer":"Я говорила по-русски"},{"type":"fill","q":"Мы уже ___. (ate)","answer":"ели"},{"type":"choose","q":"A woman says 'I worked'…","options":["Я работал","Я работала","Я работаю","Я буду работать"],"answer":"Я работала"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: вчера / работал / я","answer":"я работал вчера"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: Я работал, а потом гулял.","answer":"Я работал, а потом гулял."}],"quiz":[{"q":"ГОВОРИЛА is spoken by…","options":["men","women","children","everyone"],"answer":1,"why":"-ЛА = feminine speaker."},{"q":"ОНИ ending in past is…","options":["-л","-ла","-ло","-ли"],"answer":3,"why":"Они/мы/вы → -ЛИ."},{"q":"ВЧЕРА means…","options":["today","yesterday","tomorrow","tonight"],"answer":1,"why":"Вчера = yesterday."},{"q":"УЖЕ means…","options":["then","already","late","never"],"answer":1,"why":"Уже = already."},{"q":"ВЕЧЕРОМ means…","options":["in the morning","in the evening","at night","at noon"],"answer":1,"why":"Вечером = in the evening."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Past tense worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Russian.","items":["yesterday","already","then"],"key":["вчера","уже","потом"]},{"instruction":"Pick говорил/говорила.","items":["man: I spoke","woman: I spoke","they spoke"],"key":["я говорил","я говорила","они говорили"]},{"instruction":"Talk yesterday.","items":["I worked, then went for a walk","Interesting!"],"key":["Я работал, а потом гулял","Интересно!"]}]}},{"id":"A2-U1-L2","title":"Future with буду","learn":"The easy future: БУДУ + any verb! Я БУДУ ГОВОРИТЬ = I will speak. БУДУ/БУДЕШЬ/БУДЕТ/БУДЕМ/БУДЕТЕ/БУДУТ + infinitive. Two words, total future power!","vocab":[{"t":"скоро","r":"SKOH-rah","en":"soon","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"позже","r":"POH-zhih","en":"later","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"через час","r":"CHEH-rihs chahs","en":"in an hour","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"на следующей неделе","r":"nah SLYEH-doo-yoo-shihy nih-DYEH-lyeh","en":"next week","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"в понедельник","r":"f pah-nih-DYEHL-nyihk","en":"on Monday","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"всегда","r":"fsihg-DAH","en":"always","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"иногда","r":"een-ahg-DAH","en":"sometimes","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"никогда","r":"nee-kahg-DAH","en":"never","pos":"adverb"}],"grammar":{"title":"Буду + infinitive = will","explain":"Я БУДУ УЧИТЬ = I will learn. БУДЕШЬ (ты), БУДЕТ (он/она), БУДЕМ (мы), БУДЕТЕ (вы), БУДУТ (они). Infinitive never changes — only БУДУ moves!","pattern":"буду/будешь/будет + infinitive","examples":[{"t":"Я буду учить русский.","r":"yah BOO-doo oo-CHEETY ROO-skee.","en":"I will learn Russian."},{"t":"Мы будем говорить!","r":"mih BOO-dihm gah-vah-REETY!","en":"We will speak!"},{"t":"Они будут работать.","r":"ah-NEE BOO-doot rah-BOH-tahty.","en":"They will work."}],"mistakes":["Conjugating BOTH verbs: only БУДУ changes, infinitive stays!","Saying Я БУДЕШЬ — Я takes БУДУ!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"Иван","t":"Что ты будешь делать завтра?","r":"shtoh tih BOO-dihsh DYEH-lahty ZAHF-trah?","en":"What will you do tomorrow?"},{"sp":"Анна","t":"Я буду учить русский. А ты?","r":"yah BOO-doo oo-CHEETY ROO-skee. ah tih?","en":"I will learn Russian. And you?"},{"sp":"Иван","t":"Я буду работать, а потом гулять.","r":"yah BOO-doo rah-BOH-tahty, ah pah-TOHM goo-LYAHTY.","en":"I will work, then walk."},{"sp":"Анна","t":"Скоро увидимся!","r":"SKOH-rah oo-VEE-dihm-syah!","en":"See you soon!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I will learn Russian","answer":"Я буду учить русский"},{"type":"fill","q":"Мы ___ говорить! (will)","answer":"будем"},{"type":"choose","q":"'They will work' is…","options":["Они работают","Они будут работать","Они работали","Они работайте"],"answer":"Они будут работать"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: русский / буду / учить / я","answer":"я буду учить русский"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: Я буду учить русский.","answer":"Я буду учить русский."}],"quiz":[{"q":"Я БУДУ УЧИТЬ means…","options":["I learn","I learned","I will learn","I want learn"],"answer":2,"why":"Буду + infinitive = future."},{"q":"МЫ form of буду is…","options":["буду","будешь","будем","будут"],"answer":2,"why":"Мы БУДЕМ."},{"q":"СКОРО means…","options":["later","soon","never","always"],"answer":1,"why":"Скоро = soon."},{"q":"НИКОГДА means…","options":["sometimes","always","never","soon"],"answer":2,"why":"Никогда = never."},{"q":"Only ___ changes in буду-future.","options":["the infinitive","буду","both verbs","nothing"],"answer":1,"why":"Infinitive stays whole."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Future worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Russian.","items":["soon","always","never"],"key":["скоро","всегда","никогда"]},{"instruction":"Make futures.","items":["I will learn","We will speak","They will work"],"key":["Я буду учить","Мы будем говорить","Они будут работать"]},{"instruction":"Plan tomorrow.","items":["What will you do tomorrow?","See you soon!"],"key":["Что ты будешь делать завтра?","Скоро увидимся!"]}]}}]},{"id":"A2-U2","title":"Cases begin","lessons":[{"id":"A2-U2-L1","title":"Accusative: вижу маму","learn":"First case! The DIRECT OBJECT changes: ВИЖУ МАМУ (I see mum: -А→-У). Masculine things stay: ВИЖУ ДОМ. Verbs of going take В + accusative: ИДУ В ШКОЛУ = I go to school!","vocab":[{"t":"город","r":"GOH-rahd","en":"city","pos":"noun"},{"t":"улица","r":"OO-lee-tsah","en":"street","pos":"noun"},{"t":"магазин","r":"mah-gah-ZEEN","en":"shop","pos":"noun"},{"t":"школа","r":"SHKOH-lah","en":"school","pos":"noun"},{"t":"работа","r":"rah-BOH-tah","en":"work","pos":"noun"},{"t":"парк","r":"pahrk","en":"park","pos":"noun"},{"t":"музей","r":"moo-ZYEH-ee","en":"museum","pos":"noun"},{"t":"вокзал","r":"vahg-ZAHL","en":"station","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"Accusative: -а→-у, masculine same","explain":"Feminine -А becomes -У: МАМА→МАМУ, ШКОЛА→ШКОЛУ, МОСКВА→МОСКВУ. Masculine inanimate stays: ВИЖУ ДОМ, ИДУ В ПАРК. ИДТИ В + accusative = going TO!","pattern":"вижу/иду в + мамУ / дом(same)","examples":[{"t":"Я вижу маму.","r":"yah VEE-zhoo MAH-moo.","en":"I see mum."},{"t":"Я иду в школу.","r":"yah ee-DOO f SHKOH-loo.","en":"I go to school."},{"t":"Я иду в парк.","r":"yah ee-DOO f pahrk.","en":"I go to the park."}],"mistakes":["Saying ВИЖУ МАМА — object needs МАМУ!","Saying ИДУ В ШКОЛА — going-to needs ШКОЛУ!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"Анна","t":"Куда ты идёшь?","r":"koo-DAH tih ee-DYOHSH?","en":"Where are you going?"},{"sp":"Иван","t":"Я иду в магазин. А ты?","r":"yah ee-DOO f mah-gah-ZEEN. ah tih?","en":"I am going to the shop. And you?"},{"sp":"Анна","t":"Я иду в школу.","r":"yah ee-DOO f SHKOH-loo.","en":"I am going to school."},{"sp":"Иван","t":"Пока!","r":"pah-KAH!","en":"Bye!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I see mum","answer":"Я вижу маму"},{"type":"fill","q":"Я иду в ___ (school)","answer":"школу"},{"type":"choose","q":"'I go to the park' is…","options":["Я иду в парк","Я иду в парку","Я иду на парк","Я хожу парк"],"answer":"Я иду в парк"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: маму / вижу / я","answer":"я вижу маму"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: Я иду в школу.","answer":"Я иду в школу."}],"quiz":[{"q":"ВИЖУ МАМУ uses МАМУ because…","options":["it is the subject","it is the direct object","it is plural","it is formal"],"answer":1,"why":"Accusative: -А→-У."},{"q":"ИДУ В ШКОЛУ means…","options":["I study at school","I go to school","I see the school","I like school"],"answer":1,"why":"Идти В + accusative = going to."},{"q":"Masculine inanimate objects…","options":["add -у","stay the same","add -ы","add -а"],"answer":1,"why":"ВИЖУ ДОМ — unchanged."},{"q":"КУДА? means…","options":["Where (going)?","Where (is)?","When?","Why?"],"answer":0,"why":"Куда = where-to."},{"q":"ВОКЗАЛ means…","options":["museum","station","school","park"],"answer":1,"why":"Вокзал = (train) station."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Accusative worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Russian.","items":["city","school","station"],"key":["город","школа","вокзал"]},{"instruction":"Accusative -а→-у.","items":["I see mum","I go to school","I see (the) Moscow (Москву)"],"key":["Я вижу маму","Я иду в школу","Я вижу Москву"]},{"instruction":"Going places.","items":["Where are you going?","I am going to the shop"],"key":["Куда ты идёшь?","Я иду в магазин"]}]}},{"id":"A2-U2-L2","title":"Prepositional: в Москве","learn":"BEING somewhere uses В/НА + prepositional case: В МОСКВЕ (in Moscow), НА УРОКЕ (at the lesson). Endings: -Е mostly! КУДА? (going) vs ГДЕ? (being) — two questions, two cases!","vocab":[{"t":"Москва","r":"mahsk-VAH","en":"Moscow","pos":"noun"},{"t":"Россия","r":"rah-SEE-yah","en":"Russia","pos":"noun"},{"t":"офис","r":"OH-fees","en":"office","pos":"noun"},{"t":"стол","r":"stohl","en":"table","pos":"noun"},{"t":"урок","r":"oo-ROHK","en":"lesson","pos":"noun"},{"t":"концерт","r":"kahn-TSEHRT","en":"concert","pos":"noun"},{"t":"кино","r":"kee-NOH","en":"cinema","pos":"noun"},{"t":"дом","r":"dohm","en":"house","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"В/на + prepositional (-е)","explain":"В МОСКВЕ = in Moscow, В РОССИИ = in Russia, НА УРОКЕ = at the lesson, В ОФИСЕ = in the office. ГДЕ? (where-being) → prepositional. КУДА? (where-going) → accusative!","pattern":"где? → в/на + -е","examples":[{"t":"Я живу в Москве.","r":"yah zhih-VOO v mahsk-VYEH.","en":"I live in Moscow."},{"t":"Он на уроке.","r":"ohn nah oo-ROH-kyeh.","en":"He is at the lesson."},{"t":"Книга на столе.","r":"KNEE-gah nah stah-LYEH.","en":"The book is on the table."}],"mistakes":["Saying В МОСКВА — being-in needs В МОСКВЕ!","Mixing КУДА/ГДЕ: КУДА=going-to, ГДЕ=being-at."]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"Иван","t":"Где ты живёшь?","r":"gdyeh tih zhih-VYOHSH?","en":"Where do you live?"},{"sp":"Анна","t":"Я живу в Москве. А ты?","r":"yah zhih-VOO v mahsk-VYEH. ah tih?","en":"I live in Moscow. And you?"},{"sp":"Иван","t":"Я живу в Москве тоже!","r":"yah zhih-VOO v mahsk-VYEH TOH-zhih!","en":"I live in Moscow too!"},{"sp":"Анна","t":"Здорово!","r":"zdah-ROH-vah!","en":"Great!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I live in Moscow","answer":"Я живу в Москве"},{"type":"fill","q":"Он ___ уроке. (at)","answer":"на"},{"type":"choose","q":"'He is at the lesson' is…","options":["Он в урок","Он на уроке","Он в уроке","Он на урок"],"answer":"Он на уроке"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: Москве / живу / в / я","answer":"я живу в Москве"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: Я живу в Москве.","answer":"Я живу в Москве."}],"quiz":[{"q":"В МОСКВЕ uses -Е because…","options":["going to","being in","coming from","plural"],"answer":1,"why":"Где = prepositional."},{"q":"ГДЕ? asks…","options":["where-to","where-at","when","why"],"answer":1,"why":"Где = where-being."},{"q":"НА УРОКЕ means…","options":["to the lesson","at the lesson","from the lesson","after class"],"answer":1,"why":"На + prepositional = at."},{"q":"КНИГА НА СТОЛЕ means…","options":["book under table","book on the table","book near table","book by table"],"answer":1,"why":"На столе = on the table."},{"q":"Prepositional ending is mostly…","options":["-у","-е","-ы","-а"],"answer":1,"why":"Москв-Е, урок-Е, стол-Е."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Prepositional worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Russian.","items":["Moscow","lesson","office"],"key":["Москва","урок","офис"]},{"instruction":"Где? → prepositional.","items":["I live in Moscow","He is at the lesson","The book is on the table"],"key":["Я живу в Москве","Он на уроке","Книга на столе"]},{"instruction":"Куда vs Где.","items":["Where are you going? (куда)","Where do you live? (где)"],"key":["Куда ты идёшь?","Где ты живёшь?"]}]}}]},{"id":"A2-U3","title":"Food and shopping","lessons":[{"id":"A2-U3-L1","title":"Food and люблю","learn":"Food words + LOVE them! Я ЛЮБЛЮ + accusative: ЛЮБЛЮ МОЛОКО, ЛЮБЛЮ СЫР. ХОЧУ = I want: Я ХОЧУ ЧАЙ (I want tea). Order like a local!","vocab":[{"t":"хлеб","r":"khlyehp","en":"bread","pos":"noun"},{"t":"молоко","r":"mah-lah-KOH","en":"milk","pos":"noun"},{"t":"сыр","r":"sihr","en":"cheese","pos":"noun"},{"t":"мясо","r":"MYAH-sah","en":"meat","pos":"noun"},{"t":"рыба","r":"RIH-bah","en":"fish","pos":"noun"},{"t":"яблоко","r":"YAH-blah-kah","en":"apple","pos":"noun"},{"t":"чай","r":"cheye","en":"tea","pos":"noun"},{"t":"кофе","r":"KOH-fyeh","en":"coffee","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"Люблю + accusative","explain":"Я ЛЮБЛЮ ЧАЙ (m-same), Я ЛЮБЛЮ РЫБУ (-а→-у!). Neuter stays: ЛЮБЛЮ МОЛОКО, ЛЮБЛЮ ЯБЛОКО. ХОЧУ works the same: ХОЧУ КОФЕ!","pattern":"люблю/хочу + accusative","examples":[{"t":"Я люблю сыр.","r":"yah lyoo-BLYOO sihr.","en":"I love cheese."},{"t":"Я люблю рыбу.","r":"yah lyoo-BLYOO RIH-boo.","en":"I love fish."},{"t":"Я хочу чай!","r":"yah khah-CHOO cheye!","en":"I want tea!"}],"mistakes":["Saying ЛЮБЛЮ РЫБА — object needs РЫБУ!","Forgetting ХОЧУ's Ч: khah-CHOO, not khah-KOO."]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"Анна","t":"Что ты любишь?","r":"shtoh tih LYOO-beesh?","en":"What do you love?"},{"sp":"Иван","t":"Я люблю сыр и хлеб. А ты?","r":"yah lyoo-BLYOO sihr ee khlyehp. ah tih?","en":"I love cheese and bread. And you?"},{"sp":"Анна","t":"Я люблю рыбу. Я хочу чай!","r":"yah lyoo-BLYOO RIH-boo. yah khah-CHOO cheye!","en":"I love fish. I want tea!"},{"sp":"Иван","t":"И я хочу кофе!","r":"ee yah khah-CHOO KOH-fyeh!","en":"And I want coffee!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I love cheese","answer":"Я люблю сыр"},{"type":"fill","q":"Я люблю ___ (fish)","answer":"рыбу"},{"type":"choose","q":"'I want tea!' is…","options":["Я люблю чай","Я хочу чай","Я пью чай","Я ем чай"],"answer":"Я хочу чай"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: сыр / люблю / я","answer":"я люблю сыр"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: Я люблю сыр и хлеб.","answer":"Я люблю сыр и хлеб."}],"quiz":[{"q":"Я ЛЮБЛЮ РЫБУ uses РЫБУ because…","options":["subject","direct object","plural","formal"],"answer":1,"why":"Accusative -а→-у."},{"q":"ХОЧУ means…","options":["I love","I want","I eat","I drink"],"answer":1,"why":"Хочу = I want."},{"q":"СЫР means…","options":["milk","cheese","meat","fish"],"answer":1,"why":"Сыр = cheese."},{"q":"МОЛОКО sounds like…","options":["moh-loh-koh","muh-lah-koh","mee-lee-kee","mah-loh-koo"],"answer":1,"why":"Unstressed O → AH!"},{"q":"Neuter objects after ЛЮБЛЮ…","options":["add -у","stay the same","add -ы","drop -о"],"answer":1,"why":"ЛЮБЛЮ МОЛОКО — same."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Food worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Russian.","items":["cheese","fish","tea"],"key":["сыр","рыба","чай"]},{"instruction":"Love foods.","items":["I love cheese","I love fish","I want tea"],"key":["Я люблю сыр","Я люблю рыбу","Я хочу чай"]},{"instruction":"Ask tastes.","items":["What do you love?","And I want coffee!"],"key":["Что ты любишь?","И я хочу кофе!"]}]}},{"id":"A2-U3-L2","title":"Shopping: сколько стоит","learn":"Shop in Russian! СКОЛЬКО СТОИТ? = How much? ДОРОГО (expensive), ДЁШЕВО (cheap). Money: РУБЛЬ (rouble). Я БЕРУ = I'll take it!","vocab":[{"t":"цена","r":"tsih-NAH","en":"price","pos":"noun"},{"t":"деньги","r":"DYEHNY-gee","en":"money","pos":"noun"},{"t":"рубль","r":"roobly","en":"rouble","pos":"noun"},{"t":"чек","r":"chehk","en":"receipt","pos":"noun"},{"t":"скидка","r":"SKEED-kah","en":"discount","pos":"noun"},{"t":"дорого","r":"DOH-rah-gah","en":"expensive","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"дёшево","r":"dyoh-SHIH-vah","en":"cheap","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"бесплатно","r":"bihs-PLAHT-nah","en":"free","pos":"adverb"}],"grammar":{"title":"Сколько стоит? = How much?","explain":"СКОЛЬКО СТОИТ ХЛЕБ? = How much is the bread? Answer: СТО РУБЛЕЙ (100 roubles). ДОРОГО! = Expensive! Я БЕРУ = I'll take it.","pattern":"сколько стоит + nominative","examples":[{"t":"Сколько стоит хлеб?","r":"SKOHL-kah STOH-eet khlyehp?","en":"How much is the bread?"},{"t":"Сто рублей.","r":"stoh roo-BLYEHY.","en":"100 roubles."},{"t":"Дорого! Я беру.","r":"DOH-rah-gah! yah bih-ROO.","en":"Expensive! I'll take it."}],"mistakes":["Saying СКОЛЬКО СТОЯТ for one thing — СТОИТ is singular!","Forgetting РУБЛЕЙ after 5+: СТО РУБЛЕЙ."]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"Анна","t":"Сколько стоит хлеб?","r":"SKOHL-kah STOH-eet khlyehp?","en":"How much is the bread?"},{"sp":"Иван","t":"Сто рублей.","r":"stoh roo-BLYEHY.","en":"100 roubles."},{"sp":"Анна","t":"Дорого! А сыр?","r":"DOH-rah-gah! ah sihr?","en":"Expensive! And the cheese?"},{"sp":"Иван","t":"Дёшево! Я беру!","r":"dyoh-SHIH-vah! yah bih-ROO!","en":"Cheap! I'll take it!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: How much is the bread?","answer":"Сколько стоит хлеб?"},{"type":"fill","q":"Сто ___. (roubles)","answer":"рублей"},{"type":"choose","q":"'I'll take it!' is…","options":["Я хочу!","Я беру!","Я иду!","Я ем!"],"answer":"Я беру!"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: стоит / сколько / хлеб","answer":"сколько стоит хлеб"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: Сколько стоит хлеб?","answer":"Сколько стоит хлеб?"}],"quiz":[{"q":"СКОЛЬКО СТОИТ? means…","options":["How many?","How much?","Where is?","What is?"],"answer":1,"why":"Сколько стоит = how much."},{"q":"ДОРОГО means…","options":["cheap","expensive","free","new"],"answer":1,"why":"Дорого = expensive."},{"q":"ДЁШЕВО means…","options":["cheap","expensive","tasty","big"],"answer":0,"why":"Дёшево = cheap."},{"q":"СКИДКА means…","options":["receipt","discount","price","shop"],"answer":1,"why":"Скидка = discount."},{"q":"Я БЕРУ means…","options":["I want","I'll take it","I go","I pay"],"answer":1,"why":"Беру = I take."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Shopping worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Russian.","items":["price","discount","cheap"],"key":["цена","скидка","дёшево"]},{"instruction":"Shop talk.","items":["How much is the bread?","100 roubles","I'll take it!"],"key":["Сколько стоит хлеб?","Сто рублей","Я беру!"]},{"instruction":"React.","items":["Expensive!","Cheap!"],"key":["Дорого!","Дёшево!"]}]}}]}],"test":{"title":"A2 final test","items":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say (woman): I spoke Russian","answer":"Я говорила по-русски"},{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I will learn Russian","answer":"Я буду учить русский"},{"type":"choose","q":"'I go to school'","options":["Я иду в школа","Я иду в школу","Я иду на школе","Я хожу школа"],"answer":"Я иду в школу"},{"type":"translate_t","q":"Я живу в Москве.","answer":"I live in Moscow."},{"type":"fill","q":"Мы уже ___. (ate)","answer":"ели"},{"type":"choose","q":"'I see mum'","options":["Я вижу мама","Я вижу маму","Я смотрю мама","Я вижу маме"],"answer":"Я вижу маму"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: Москве / живу / в / я","answer":"я живу в Москве"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: Я люблю сыр и хлеб.","answer":"Я люблю сыр и хлеб."},{"type":"fill","q":"Сколько ___ хлеб? (costs)","answer":"стоит"},{"type":"choose","q":"Они будут работать.","options":["They work","They will work","They worked","They want work"],"answer":"They will work"}]}}}